          "title": "Guest controls",
          "body": [
            { "type": "text", "value": "Start, stop, and restart requests require the start_stop permission. NAD validates the target, records the Proxmox UPID, re-reads task and guest state, and audits confirmed, failed, or indeterminate outcomes." },
            { "type": "text", "value": "Console access is intentionally not included. A safe console needs an origin-bound ticket and WebSocket broker plus a dedicated reviewed interface." }
